        "2378": {"synopsis":"Scans the handles of type B (FindHandle, C = 0: no dynamic ID check) for one other than IX\nthat points at the same DOR (bank and address).\nEntry: IX = handle; B = handle type; C = 0.\nExit: Fc = 0 when no other handle uses the DOR.\nError: Fc = 1, A = RC_Use.\nKeeps: IX, IY."},
        "2391": {"comment":"no more entries? exit Fc=0"},
        "2393": {"comment":"HL=IX, DE=IY"},
