        "2597": {"comment":"Fz=1 if no keys down"},
        "2599": {"synopsis":"Waits, snoozing a tick at a time with the timer and global interrupts enabled, until no key\nis down, then falls into NMI_Off.\nEntry: none.\nChanges: AF, BC, DE, HL."},
        "2604": {"comment":"keys down? loop"},
        "2606": {"synopsis":"Keeps the machine switched off after a power-fail or coma NMI: sleeps until a key is pressed\nand stays off unless both Shift keys are down (BothShifts). With both Shifts held it waits;\nonce no key is down it returns. Any other key goes back to NMI_Off0.\nEntry: none.\nChanges: AF, BC, DE, HL."},
        "2614": {"comment":"switch off until kbd"},
        "2623": {"comment":"not both shifts? stay off"},
        "2630": {"comment":"no keys? exit"},
