        "2641": {"comment":"some other key, wait until released"},
        "2643": {"synopsis":"switch machine off"},
        "2650": {"comment":"sound active? don't switch off"},
        "2654": {"comment":"Fc=0"},
        "2656": {"synopsis":"Switches the machine off: disables keyboard reading from the interrupt (KBF_B_SWOFF), turns\nthe LCD off and snoozes, waking for alarms (next alarm time from ubNextAlmMinutesB) and\nkeys. It stays off until an alarm task is pending or both Shift keys are pressed; Caps Lock\nheld with them sets the keyboard lock. Then restores the keyboard flags, resets the timeout,\nclears ITSK_B_SHUTDOWN and turns the LCD on.\nEntry: none.\nChanges: AF, BC.\nKeeps: DE, HL."},
        "2665": {"comment":"disable kbd reading from interrupt"},
        "2672": {"comment":"LCD off"},
        "2687": {"comment":"keys down"},
