        "2850": {"comment":"task happen, return"},
        "2858": {"synopsis":"Entry inside OSWaitMain: snoozes until the next tick or interrupt, with H = the INT soft\ncopy with keyboard wait set and the global interrupt bit clear (snooze, not coma) and L =\nBM_TACKTICK; falls into DoSnooze.\nEntry: none.\nExit: H = INT mask used; L = BM_TACKTICK.\nChanges: HL."},
