        "3099": {"synopsis":"From HW_NMI (ROM, coma state)\nHappens when a power failure, flap open or card insertion during coma","comment":"return to nmi2_1 thru ROM stack"},
        "3103": {"comment":"Fc=1, snooze 3 ticks - Fc=0, switch off"},
        "3108": {"synopsis":"Continuation of HW_NMI2, reached through a return address stored in ROM after UpdSoftClock.\nRestores SP from IX and prepares the coma: with Fc = 1 (fewer than three NMIs this second) C\n= 0, so the machine wakes after the coma; with Fc = 0, C is nonzero and the machine stays\noff (NMI_Off on wake-up). Resets the COM register keeping RAM bank $20 at $0000, sets I =\nCOMA_RDSK and jumps to Halt.\nEntry: A = count; HL = TIM2|TIM1; Fc from UpdSoftClock; IX = saved SP; C = port BL_TIM2."},
        "3114": {"comment":"Fc = 0 : C = BL_TIM1 (not zero), switch off (coma)"},
        "3116": {"comment":"Fc = 1 : dont switch off, snooze 3 ticks before coma"},
        "3123": {"comment":"reset command register (but keep bank $20 in lower 8K)"},
        "3125": {"comment":"$3F"},
        "3127": {"comment":"Enter Coma state and wait for both SHIFT keys (A8-A15)"},
        "3132": {"synopsis":"From NMI (RAM, awake state)\nHappens when a power failure, flap open or card insertion"},
        "3145": {"comment":"update"},
        "3151": {"comment":"snooze during 3 ticks"},
        "3154": {"comment":"before switching off"},
        "3161": {"synopsis":"Counts 3 occurrences (ticks) during the same second\nEntry: A = count, D = TIM2, E = TIM1.\nExit: Fc = 1, not 3 : A = count, HL = TIM2|TIM1; Fc = 0, 3 successives occurences have\nhappen during the same second."},
