        "3518": {"synopsis":"Part of OS_Op: sets the file's attributes to its flags (bits 7-3) and the open mode from the\nframe's A, reads or writes the DOR's son pointer (record 1, 2 bytes) from or into\nfhnd_firstblk of the handle with OS_Dor, and falls into the type change from device\n(HND_DEV) to file handle (HND_FILE).\nEntry: A = DR_RD (open existing) or DR_WR (new file); IX = handle; IY = OS frame.\nError: Fc = 1, A = error code."},
        "3524": {"comment":"IN=1, UP=3, OUT=2"},
