        "3548": {"comment":"change dev to file"},
        "3554": {"comment":"delete DOR"},
        "3574": {"synopsis":"Part of OS_Op: creates a file or directory DOR under the directory handle IX (DR_CRE), sets\nits name and update and creation dates (FileNameDate), inserts it as a son of the parent\n(DR_INS; a failure there hangs) and frees the parent's handle.\nEntry: B = DOR type (DN_FIL or DN_DIR); IX = parent directory handle; caller's HL = name.\nExit: IX = handle of the new DOR.\nError: Fc = 1, A = error code (the parent handle is freed)."},
