        "3642": {"synopsis":"Entry inside OSCl for a writable file: writes the file size (GetFileSize, DEHL) into the\nDOR's 'X' (extent) record, then frees the data of a memory file and the handle\n(DORHndFreeDirect). OSClDel uses it to close a file without deleting it.\nEntry: IX = handle (device type).","comment":"into DEHL"},
