        "4030": {"comment":"no timeout"},
        "4038": {"synopsis":"write byte with timeout"},
        "4050": {"synopsis":"OS_Pb/OS_Pbt body: writes the frame's A to handle IX. Special handles: 5 writes the serial\nport (OSSiPbt), 2 the screen driver, 3 the printer (OS_Prt), 4 (NUL) discards it, 7 standard\noutput (OS_Out), 8 the direct printer filter; 1 and 6 give RC_Wp, others RC_Hand. A file\nhandle must be writable (WrFileByte); a write error marks it for deletion.\nEntry: IX = handle; BC = timeout (-1 = none); IY = OS frame with the byte in A.\nExit: Fc = 0.\nError: Fc = 1, A = error code (RC_Wp, RC_Hand, ...)."},
        "4055": {"comment":"Com handle = 5"},
        "4060": {"comment":"byte to be written"},
        "4063": {"comment":"5 - write byte to serial port"},
        "4070": {"comment":"1 - keyboard - write protected"},
        "4074": {"comment":"2 - write byte to screen"},
