        "7051": {"synopsis":"Entry inside DeadKeys: cancels a pending dead key. Clears ubKmDeadchar (shown as a space in\nthe OZ window) and ubKmDeadsub, redraws the OZ window (DrawOZwd) and returns Fc = 1, which\nDeadKeys' callers read as a swallowed key.\nEntry: none.\nExit: Fc = 1; A = 0.\nKeeps: BC.","comment":"cancel deadkey"},
