        "7214": {"synopsis":"Table of 9 bytes read by FindOtherKey, three rows of three: the masks of the non-qualifier\nkeys in keyboard rows 0-5, 6 and 7 ($FF, $AF, $3F); the SHIFT key bit in those rows (none,\n$40 left SHIFT, $80 right SHIFT); and the kbd_flags bit set for the qualifier in rows 6 and\n7 (none, KBF_DMND, KBF_SQR)."},
        "7223": {"synopsis":"Scan keyboard matrix\nEntry: -.\nExit: Fc = 0, Fz = 1, key in one column has been pressed; Fc = 1, keys in multiple columns\npressed."},
