        "8163": {"synopsis":"Checks for OS_Axm that each of L pages from the page in OSFrame_H is free, calling axm_vp\nfor each and advancing OSFrame_H.\nEntry: L = number of pages; OSFrame_B = bank; OSFrame_H = first page; IX = memory handle.\nExit: Fc = 0, all pages free; OSFrame_H = past the last page.\nError: Fc = 1, A = RC_Fail (no RAM in bank) or RC_Room (a page already allocated)."},
