        "8176": {"synopsis":"Checks for OS_Axm that one page is free: finds its MAT entry with GetPageMAT for the bank in\nOSFrame_B and the pool's segment, and tests its next pointer.\nEntry: OSFrame_B = bank; OSFrame_H = page address high byte; IX = memory handle.\nExit: Fc = 0 when the page is free.\nError: Fc = 1, A = RC_Fail (no RAM in bank) or RC_Room (page allocated).","comment":"remember bank"},
