        "8288": {"synopsis":"Allocates one explicit page for OS_Axp and OS_Axm: finds its MAT entry with GetPageMAT and,\nwhen it is free, jumps to MarkPageAlloc to add it to the pool's chain.\nEntry: B = bank; OSFrame_H = page address high byte; IX = memory handle.\nExit: Fc = 0, HL = MAT entry of the page.\nError: Fc = 1, A = RC_Fail (no RAM in bank) or RC_Room (page already allocated).","comment":"bank"},
