        "8311": {"synopsis":"Checks the arguments of OS_Axm and OS_Fxm: L must be 1 to 64 pages (32 for a segment 0\npool), a full 64 (or 32) needs a page offset of zero, and the run must not cross the end of\nthe bank. Falls into AxpPrepare.\nEntry: H = page address high byte; L = number of pages; IX = memory handle; IY = OS frame.\nExit: as AxpPrepare.\nError: Fc = 1, A = RC_Fail.","comment":"64 pages max, 32 if segment 0"},
