        "9804": {"synopsis":"Marks in the MAT the blocks used by a chain of filesystem DORs, recursively; MarkAllFsBlocks\nis its entry for the root. For each DOR from DE it marks the DOR's own block (MarkFsBlock),\nthen the blocks of a file (MarkFileBlocks) or, for a directory or device, the DORs below it\nby a recursive call, and moves on to the brother. S1 and HL are saved for each level.\nEntry: DE = file pointer of the first DOR (0 = none).\nExit: S1 and HL restored.\nError: a bad DOR type or a MarkFsBlock error prints \"FS Error\" with OS_Pout and returns.","comment":"remember S1"},
        "9812": {"comment":"error? exit"},
        "9814": {"comment":"done? exit"},
        "9818": {"comment":"restore S1"},
        "9821": {"synopsis":"here is the entry point\n\nDE=root filepointer","comment":"remember S1"},
        "9829": {"comment":"get DOR type"},
        "9834": {"comment":"son"},
        "9841": {"comment":"DE=BC, son"},
        "9843": {"comment":"mark blocks of this file"},
        "9846": {"comment":"continue to brother"},
        "9848": {"comment":"dir and device share same code"},
        "9854": {"comment":"bad type? exit"},
        "9856": {"comment":"recursive call"},
        "9859": {"comment":"brother"},
        "9869": {"comment":"filesystem error"},
        "9879": {"comment":"restore S1"},
        "9883": {"synopsis":"get DOR pointer just before HL and convert it into FilePtr in DE"},
        "9892": {"comment":"DE=fileptr(BHL)"},
        "9895": {"comment":"original HL-3"},
        "9896": {"comment":"ptr from DOR, no bank"},
        "9898": {"synopsis":"bind in bank specified by FilePtr in DE, BHL=memptr"},
        "9905": {"comment":"S1 fix"},
        "9910": {"synopsis":"mark file blocks as used\nuses bits 0-3 of MAT temporarily","comment":"remember S1"},
        "9918": {"comment":"error? exit"},
        "9920": {"comment":"done? exit"},
        "9925": {"comment":"get next fs block"},
        "9930": {"comment":"not end? mark it too"},
        "9932": {"comment":"!! 'pop hl; pop af; jp MS1BankA'"},
        "9934": {"synopsis":"mark single filesystem block\nEntry: DE=FilePtr.\nExit: Fz=1 if DE=0; Fc=0 if successfull; Fc=1 if block already marked."},
        "9936": {"comment":"file pointer 0, exit"},
        "9938": {"comment":"HL=D"},
