        "542": {"synopsis":"EP_Empty interface:\nOZ source name: ozFileEprEmptyFileArea.\nEntry: C = poll for empty file area in slot number 0, 1, 2 or 3.\nExit: Fz = 1, File area is empty (all bytes are FFh); Fz = 0, File area is not empty; B =\nbank that contains non-empty bytes; Fc = 1,; A = RC_ONF (File Eprom Card/Area not available;\npossibly no card in slot)."},
        "549": {"comment":"return B as bank which contains non-cleared bytes on UV Eprom"},
        "553": {"synopsis":"Blow block of data to UV Eprom in slot 3.\nScreen will be switched off during operation.\nEntry: C = Blowing algorithm context (also known as File Area sub type); DE = source address\n(local address space pointer); IX = length of block; BHL = destination address in slot 3.\nExit: Fc = 0 (block blown successfully to UV Eprom); BHL updated; Fc = 1,; A = RC_BWR (write\nerror); A = RC_Onf (unknown blowing algorithm context).\nChanges: AF, B, HL.\nKeeps: C, DE, IX, IY.","comment":"preserve IX"},
        "566": {"comment":"unknown blowing algorithm context"},
        "570": {"comment":"return updated BHL pointer (end of block +1) or error status"},
        "573": {"synopsis":"Get slot number C (embedded in Bank number B).\nEntry: B = absolute bank number.\nExit: C = slot number which bank B is part of.\nChanges: C.\nKeeps: AF, B, DE, HL, IX, IY."},
        "579": {"comment":"slot C (of bank B)"},
        "582": {"synopsis":"Read file from File Area in slot 3\nEntry: BHL = source filename; IX = output file handle.\nExit: Fc=0, file fetched successfully to RAM file; Fc=1, A=error if fail.\nChanges: AF, BC, DE, HL."},
