        "850": {"synopsis":"Create file area header in UV Eprom card (or Flash card, if available) in slot C.\nOn UV Eprom, on the header is created - on Flash, the complete file area is formatted.\nEntry: C = slot.\nExit: Fc=0, File Area formatted (either Flash or UV Eprom) in slot 3.; Fc=1, A=error if\nfail.\nChanges: AF, BC, DE, HL, IX."},
