        "1031": {"synopsis":"Identify empty UV EPROM by trying to blow the sub type of the File Area header.\nEntry: BHL=test address ($FF:3FFD, subtype); IX = handle to UV Eprom programming settings.\nExit: Fc=0, A=type, IX = handle to UV EProm programming settings; Fc=1, A=error if fail.\nChanges: AF, IX."},
