        "1069": {"synopsis":"Write memory block to UV EPROM\nEntry: BC'=number of bytes to write; DE=source address; IX = handle to UV Eprom programming\nsettings; BHL=EPROM pointer.\nExit: Fc=0 if success; Fc=1, A=error if fail.\nChanges: AF, BC, HL."},
