        "1109": {"synopsis":"Write byte to UV EPROM\nEntry: A=byte; BHL=EPROM pointer; IX = handle to UV Eprom programming settings.\nExit: Fc=0 if write succesfull; Fc=1, A=RC_BWR.\nChanges: AF."},
