        "1363": {"comment":"Application Rom found"},
        "1366": {"comment":"invalid Application Type Code..."},
        "1368": {"comment":"If FRONT DOR is located in a RAM card, return type $82"},
        "1371": {"comment":"D = size of reserved Application space (16K bank entities)"},
        "1372": {"comment":"E = Application ROM Type Code ($80 or $81)"},
        "1377": {"comment":"C = physical card size (16K bank entities)"},
        "1378": {"comment":"B = size of reserved Application space (16K bank entities)"},
        "1379": {"comment":"A = Application ROM Type Code ($80 or $81)"},
        "1380": {"comment":"original HL restored"},
        "1381": {"comment":"original DE restored"},
        "1389": {"synopsis":"Calculate physical size of Card by scanning for \"OZ\" header from\nbank $3E downwards in available 1MB slot.\n\nHL = offset $3F00 (mapped to free segment in address space).\nEntry: B = top bank of slot containing Front DOR.; A = size of reserved Application space\n(16K bank entities).\nExit: A = physical size of card in 16K entities.\nChanges: AF.\nKeeps: BC, DE, HL, IX, IY."},
        "1390": {"comment":"preserve top bank number in slot"},
