        "1459": {"synopsis":"Check for \"OZ\" watermark at bank B, offset $3FFE.\n\nFailure:\nFz = 0,\n\"OZ\" watermark not found.\nEntry: B = Bank (usually $3F, mapped to slot X) containing possible Front DOR.; HL = offset\n$3F00 (mapped to free segment).\nExit: Success:; Fz = 1,; \"OZ\" watermark found in bank B.\nChanges: F.\nKeeps: A, BC, DE, HL, IX, IY."},
        "1470": {"comment":"'OZ' ?"},
        "1474": {"comment":"original A restored"},
        "1476": {"comment":"Fz = ?"},
        "1477": {"synopsis":"Convert relative BHL pointer for slot number A (0 to 3) to absolute\npointer, addressed for binding MS_S1 segment.\n\nInternal Support Library Routine.\n\nDesign & programming by Gunther Strube, April 1998, July 2006, Aug 2012\nEntry: A = slot number (0 to 3); BHL = relative pointer.\nExit: BHL pointer, absolute addressed for physical slot A, and free segment.\nChanges: AF, B, HL.\nKeeps: C, DE, IX, IY."},
        "1479": {"comment":"clear before masking to assure proper effect..."},
        "1481": {"comment":"only slot 0 - 3 allowed..."},
        "1484": {"comment":"Slot number A converted to slot mask"},
        "1488": {"comment":"slot 0 rom bank range is $00 - $1F"},
