        "3306": {"synopsis":"Build the file entry header\nOZ source name: BuildFileEntryHdr.\nEntry: A = length of filename (incl. '/' - first byte of filename); HL = pointer to File\nEntry Header on Stack Buffer (first byte for length, followed by '/'); IX = handle of opened\nRAM file.\nExit: HL = HL(in); Fc = 0: File Entry ready, file area exist; ready to blow hdr + stream\ndata; Fc = 1, File area not found or No Room.","comment":"(length byte) - This is start of File Entry Header..."},
        "3308": {"comment":"preserve length of filename"},
        "3313": {"comment":"point at beyond last character of filename..."},
        "3316": {"comment":"DE = 0"},
        "3318": {"comment":"get size of file image in DEBC (32bit integer)"},
        "3326": {"comment":"File Entry now ready..."},
        "3327": {"comment":"length of filename (excl. device)"},
        "3328": {"comment":"total size = length of filename + 1 + file length"},
        "3330": {"comment":"(4 bytes)"},
        "3343": {"comment":"scan File Eprom in slot X for free space"},
        "3351": {"comment":"Flash card not found in slot C..."},
        "3354": {"comment":"and we're not in slot 3 (saving file will fail...)"},
