        "5300": {"synopsis":"Program block of data on an AMD/STM Flash Memory\n(this routine is optionally copied on the stack and executed there)\nOZ source name: FEP_ExecWriteBlock_29F.\nEntry: BHL = pointer to blow data; C = MS_Sx segment specifier; DE = pointer to source data;\nIX = size of data."},
        "5303": {"comment":"install block size."},
