        "10795": {"synopsis":"OS_Sp main part, called by OSSp in kernel 0 after OSFramePush. Checks the reason's high byte\n($80-$8E), pushes NqSp_ret as the return address and jumps through OSSpTable (one JP per 3\nin the high byte): $80xx SpPanel (Panel and PrinterEd settings), $83xx, $86xx and $89xx do\nnothing, $8Cxx hands the frame to DC_Sp (Director and CLI settings).\nEntry: B = reason high byte; IY = OS frame (C, A, HL of the call are read from it).\nExit: as the handler; the handler gets A = C = reason low byte, B = 0.\nError: Fc = 1, A = RC_Unk when B is outside $80-$8E.","comment":"reason $80xx-$8exx"},
        "10804": {"comment":"push return address"},
        "10808": {"comment":"reason high byte"},
        "10815": {"comment":"push function address"},
        "10827": {"comment":"$80xx Sp Panel"},
        "10830": {"comment":"$83xx"},
        "10833": {"comment":"$86xx"},
        "10836": {"comment":"$89xx"},
        "10842": {"comment":"Handle Director/CLI settings"},
        "10846": {"synopsis":"OS_Nq main part, called by OSNq in kernel 0 after OSFramePush. Checks the reason's high byte\n($80-$8E), pushes NqSp_ret as the return address and jumps through OSNqTable (one JP per 3\nin the high byte): $80xx NqPanel, $83xx OSNqWindow, $86xx OSNqProcess, $89xx OSNqMemory,\n$8Cxx OSNqDirector (DC_Nq).\nEntry: B = reason high byte; IY = OS frame (C, A, DE of the call are read from it).\nExit: as the handler; the handler gets A = C = reason low byte, B = 0.\nError: Fc = 1, A = RC_Unk when B is outside $80-$8E.","comment":"reason $80xx-8exx  !! re-use code with OSSp jumper"},
        "10855": {"comment":"push return address"},
        "10859": {"comment":"reason high byte"},
        "10866": {"comment":"push function address"},
        "10896": {"comment":"Handle Director/CLI enquiries"},
