        "11630": {"synopsis":"Makes pPrefs1 the current preferences data: stores DE in pPrefs1, clears IST_B_2 at (HL) and\nreturns the other pointer, pPrefs2.\nEntry: DE = new preferences data; HL = ubIntStatus.\nExit: DE = pPrefs2 (the previous data).\nChanges: DE.\nKeeps: AF."},
        "11641": {"synopsis":"Makes pPrefs2 the current preferences data: stores DE in pPrefs2, sets IST_B_2 at (HL) and\nreturns the other pointer, pPrefs1.\nEntry: DE = new preferences data; HL = ubIntStatus.\nExit: DE = pPrefs1 (the previous data).\nChanges: DE.\nKeeps: AF."},
