        "11744": {"synopsis":"Table of country settings read by RstRdPanelAttrs: a count byte ($0E), then 14 entries of 6\nbytes: the PA_Loc country letter, the date filter table (word), two country-ID letters with\nbit 7 set (for the OZ window) and the keymap's page in the keymap bank. The first entry (UK)\nis the default when the country is not found.","comment":"number of keymaps"},
        "11748": {"comment":"UK (default)"},
