        "5446": {"synopsis":"Exit of GN_Sip, reached on ENTER, ESC, a special key or an error. Counts the null in the\nlength, stores A, B and C in the frame, restores the window's margins to its full width\n(NQ_Wbox) when single line lock was used, and restores the bindings saved by OS_Bix with\nOS_Box before returning.\nEntry: A = terminating key or error code; B = line length; C = cursor position; IY = OS\nframe; stack top = bindings from OS_Bix.\nExit: frame A = key, B = length including the null, C = cursor position.","comment":"include null to length"},
