        "5478": {"synopsis":"GN_Sip's handler of the DEL key: does nothing with the cursor at the start; otherwise moves\nleft. In insert mode it deletes that character (DelChar) and redraws the rest; in overwrite\nmode it replaces it with a space, shortening the line when it was the last one. Returns to\nthe input loop sip_main.\nEntry: B = line length; C = cursor; DE = buffer at the cursor; H bit 2 = overwrite mode.\nError: an output error goes to sip_err."},
        "5480": {"comment":"cursor at 0? exit"},
        "5482": {"comment":"move left"},
