        "5861": {"synopsis":"GN_Sip's handling of a special key (a control key or a key the editor cannot act on): when\nbit 3 of the caller's A asks for special keys to be returned it exits through sip_x with the\nkey, otherwise it goes back to the input loop sip_main.\nEntry: A = key; IY = OS frame.","comment":"return special?"},
        "5865": {"comment":"no? loop"},
