        "11360": {"comment":"(60*60*24)%$10000"},
        "11366": {"comment":"get seconds since midnight"},
        "11380": {"comment":"get centiseconds"},
        "11393": {"synopsis":"LD DE,data_buf1\nEXX\nLD d,0\nLD e,10\nEXX\nFPP(fp_str) ;get string representation\nXOR A\nLD (DE),A\nPUSH HL\nLD HL,data_buf1\nCALL_OZ(gn_sop)\nCALL_OZ(gn_nln)\nPOP HL\nLD C,0\nLD HL,time\nCALL_OZ(gn_sdo)\nCALL_OZ(gn_nln)\nOZ source name: end_of_date_time_convert.","comment":"open file/stream for output"},
