        "12750": {"synopsis":"Ends a Ymodem batch: sends an empty header block, SOH, block 0, $FF and 130 zero bytes (the\ndata and a zero CRC), then purges the input.\nExit: Fc = 1 (from purge).\nError: Fc = 1 if a byte cannot be sent.\nChanges: AF, BC, HL, AF', BC'."},
        "12783": {"synopsis":"OZ source name: end_of_retries_quit_to_main."},
