        "828": {"synopsis":"Switches the serial port to Xon/Xoff (software) handshaking: records SerportXonXoffMode in\nCurrentSerportMode, clears SignalSerportMode, writes 'Using Xon/Xoff' and sets the Panel to\nXon/Xoff yes (SetPanel_SoftwareHandshaking, which installs the settings).\nOZ source name: UseSoftwareHandshaking.\nEntry: none.\nKeeps: AF, BC, HL."},
        "833": {"comment":"remember new setting"},
        "837": {"comment":"change done"},
        "843": {"comment":"\"Switching to Xon/Xoff serial port handshake\""},
        "846": {"comment":"For PCLINK II protocol, use 9600 Tx/Rx, Parity No, Xon/Xoff Yes"},
        "853": {"synopsis":"Switches the serial port to RTS/CTS (hardware) handshaking: records SerportHardwareMode in\nCurrentSerportMode, clears SignalSerportMode, writes 'Using RTS/CTS' and sets the Panel to\nXon/Xoff no (SetPanel_HardwareHandshaking, which installs the settings).\nOZ source name: UseHardwareHandshaking.\nEntry: none.\nKeeps: AF, BC, HL."},
        "858": {"comment":"remember new setting"},
        "862": {"comment":"change done"},
        "868": {"comment":"\"Switching to Hardware serial port handshake\""},
        "871": {"comment":"For EazyLink protocol, use 9600 Tx/Rx, Parity No, Xon/Xoff No"},
