        "956": {"synopsis":"Display a flashing 'PCLINK II' text in bottom of topic window.\n(while a PCLINK II command is being executed)\nOZ source name: DisplayPclinkIIText."},
        "959": {"synopsis":"Inline OS_Pout string of DisplayPclinkIIText: selects window \"7\", moves to column 0, row 7\nand writes 'PCLINK II' flashing (\"2+F\", grey off with \"2-G\"), then flash off.\nNull-terminated."},
        "992": {"synopsis":"Remove the flashing 'PCLINK II' text in bottom of topic window.\n(a PCLINK II command was completed)\nOZ source name: RemovePclinkIIText."},
        "995": {"synopsis":"Inline OS_Pout string of RemovePclinkIIText: selects window \"7\", moves to column 0, row 7\nand clears to the end of the line (1, \"2C\", 253). Null-terminated."},
