        "2711": {"synopsis":"Writes a message as a new line in the log window: selects window \"3\" (vdulog), writes the\nstring (GN_Sop) and a new line (GN_Nln).\nEntry: HL = null-terminated message.\nKeeps: AF, HL."},
        "2715": {"synopsis":"Inline OS_Pout string of Write_message: 1, \"2H3\", null-terminated, which selects the log\nwindow \"3\".","comment":"use log window for message"},
        "2729": {"synopsis":"Saves the current machine time (GN_Gmt) in timestamp (3 bytes, centiseconds), the start of a\ntransfer for Disp_Elapsedtime.\nEntry: none.\nChanges: AF.\nKeeps: BC, DE, HL."},
        "2737": {"comment":"current internal machine time"},
