        "2751": {"synopsis":"Writes the time passed since Get_Time: reads the machine time (GN_Gmt), stores the\ndifference in timestamp, writes \" in \" and the elapsed time (GN_Ptm to the standard output\nhandle, from OS_Nq NQ_OHN), then a new line.\nOZ source name: Display_Elapsedtime.\nEntry: timestamp = the start time from Get_Time.\nChanges: BC, DE, HL.\nKeeps: AF, IX."},
        "2759": {"comment":"current internal machine time"},
