        "2838": {"synopsis":"Writes 'File received' to the log window, followed by the transfer time (Disp_Elapsedtime).\nOZ source name: Msg_file_received.\nEntry: timestamp = the start time from Get_Time.\nChanges: BC, DE, HL.\nKeeps: AF."},
