        "3018": {"synopsis":"PCLINK II command ESC \"N\": sends the names of the files that match a path. Fetches the path\nwith acknowledgements (Fetch_pathname_ackn, translation on for it), then sends each matching\nfile name as ESC \"N\" <name> and ends with ESC \"Z\". A failure writes 'command aborted'; the\ntranslation flag is restored in any case.\nEntry: IX = start_workspace."},
        "3021": {"comment":"load pathname into filename_buffer"},
        "3028": {"comment":"signal filenames to be found"},
        "3031": {"comment":"wildcard search specifier"},
        "3041": {"comment":"no more names"},
        "3051": {"comment":"write message and set Fz"},
        "3057": {"synopsis":"PCLINK II command ESC \"G\": sends a Z88 file to the PC. Writes 'Send file', fetches the name\n(Fetch_pathname_ackn), opens the file and sends it byte by byte with acknowledgements: a CR\ngoes as CR LF when CRLF conversion is on, a control code below 32 as ESC \"B\" <hex>. Ends\nwith ESC \"Z\" and the 'File sent' time; a failure writes 'command aborted' and closes the\nfile.\nEntry: IX = start_workspace."},
        "3074": {"comment":"read system time, to know elapsed time of sent file"},
        "3093": {"comment":"load new block into buffer..."},
        "3096": {"comment":"EOF reached..."},
