        "3235": {"synopsis":"Receives a path name with the PCLINK II byte-by-byte acknowledgement (Getbyte_ackn) into\nfilename_buffer, up to ESC and the byte after it ('Z' or 'F'). Appends '*' and a null,\nkeeping the position of the '*' in buffer.\nOZ source name: Fetch_pathname_ackn.\nEntry: none.\nExit: Fc = 0; filename_buffer = the path + \"*\"; (buffer) = address of the '*'.\nError: Fc = 1 from Getbyte_ackn (serial port error or timeout).\nChanges: AF, HL."},
