        "3264": {"synopsis":"PCLINK II command ESC \"S\": receives files from the PC. Writes 'Receive files', then for each\nESC \"N\" <name> creates the file (directories included) and writes the bytes that follow\nuntil ESC \"E\": ESC \"B\" <hex> gives a raw byte and a LF is dropped when CRLF conversion is\non. ESC \"Z\" ends the batch. A protocol error aborts the file; a full RAM answers $01 to the\nPC.\nEntry: IX = start_workspace."},
