        "3569": {"synopsis":"EazyLink command ESC \"n\": sends the names of the files that match a path, each as ESC \"N\"\n<name>, ending with ESC \"Z\". A path in a file card (\":EPR.x\") lists the entries of that\nslot's file area instead (OS_Epr EP_Name). Translation is on while the path is fetched; a\nfailure writes 'command aborted'.\nEntry: IX = start_workspace."},
        "3572": {"comment":"load pathname into filename_buffer"},
