        "7958": {"comment":"EazyLink Switch to Xon/Xoff RS232 protocol (software handshaking)"},
        "7959": {"comment":"EazyLink Switch to RTS/CTS RS232 protocol (hardware handshaking)"},
        "7960": {"synopsis":"Table of words: the handler address of each ESC command, in the order of the command letters\nin EscCommands. EscCommand finds the letter's index, doubles it, reads the word here and\njumps to it.","comment":"Address of subroutines:"},
        "7972": {"comment":"Address of   PCLINK II 'Quit'"},
