        "9308": {"synopsis":"The Filer's main loop: reads a key with OS_In and acts on it. RC_Quit and RC_Esc leave\nthrough ExitFiler, RC_Draw redraws with InitDisplay. A zero byte is followed by an extended\ncode: ENTER, the four arrows, $20 (ShEnter), $32 (ChDirDown), $31 (ChDirUp) and $21-$30\n(DoCmd with A = 0-15); other keys are ignored.","comment":"read a byte from std. input"},
