        "10226": {"synopsis":"Closes the source resource if one is open: frees it with OS_Dor (DR_FRE) when bit 4 of\nf_CmdFlags marks a DOR, otherwise closes it with OS_Cl, and writes IX back to\nf_SourceHandle.\nEntry: f_SourceHandle = handle or 0.\nChanges: AF, DE, IX."},
        "10237": {"comment":"DOR or file"},
        "10243": {"comment":"free DOR"},
        "10247": {"comment":"close file/stream"},
        "10255": {"synopsis":"Closes the temporary file with OS_Cl if f_TmpFileHandle holds a handle, and writes IX back\nto f_TmpFileHandle.\nEntry: f_TmpFileHandle = handle or 0.\nChanges: AF, DE, IX."},
        "10263": {"comment":"close file/stream"},
        "10271": {"synopsis":"Closes the destination file with OS_Cl if f_DestHandle holds a handle, and writes IX back to\nf_DestHandle.\nEntry: f_DestHandle = handle or 0.\nExit: Fz = 0 when a file was closed; Fz = 1 when there was none.\nChanges: AF, DE, IX."},
        "10279": {"comment":"close file/stream"},
