        "14944": {"synopsis":"Copies the name of the current device (OS_Nq, NQ_Dev) into f_SourceName (CopyExtended).\nEntry: none.\nExit: f_SourceName = device name with its terminator (a byte below $21); DE = the\nterminator; Fc = 0.\nChanges: AF, BC, DE, HL."},
        "14947": {"comment":"get current device"},
        "14954": {"synopsis":"Copies the name of the current directory (OS_Nq, NQ_Dir) into f_SourceName; falls into\nCopyExtended.\nEntry: none.\nExit: f_SourceName = directory name with its terminator (a byte below $21); DE = the\nterminator; Fc = 0.\nChanges: AF, BC, DE, HL."},
        "14957": {"comment":"get current directory"},
        "14962": {"synopsis":"Copy extended : copy data from (BHL) to (DE) until control char\nEntry: bhl = source, de = destination buffer.\nExit: -.","comment":"Read byte at extended address"},
        "14974": {"synopsis":"Copy filename : copy (HL) into (DE) until control char, return # bytes copied\nEntry: hl = source, de = destination buffer.\nExit: c = number of bytes copied."},
        "14987": {"synopsis":"View File as binary dump. Main keyboard input & cursor movement logic loop"},
        "14999": {"comment":"initialize CRC-32 to FFFFFFFFh before processing file..."},
