        "6115": {"synopsis":"After a file was saved, refreshes the file statistics window (FileEpromStatistics) when Fc =\n0, then selects window 2 again (filewindow).\nOZ source name: UpdateFileAreaStats.\nEntry: Fc = 0 to refresh the statistics.\nKeeps: AF, HL."},
        "6129": {"synopsis":"Checks that the current slot can take new files: the card must support writing\n(SlotWriteSupport) and hold a file area (OS_Epr EP_Req). On failure it shows the error\n(DispIntelSlotErr or disp_no_filearea_msg).\nEntry: (curslot) = slot.\nExit: Fc = 0, Fz = 1: file area found and writable.\nError: Fc = 1 or Fz = 0, the message was shown.\nChanges: AF, BC, DE, HL.","comment":"C = (curslot)"},
