        "6347": {"synopsis":"OZ source name: CompressRamFileName.\nEntry: HL = pointer to explicit filename; C = number of characters in expanded filename at\n(HL); returns; HL = pointer to compressed filename (buffer), or original HL; length of\nfilename fits within 42 characters."},
        "6351": {"comment":"filename fits within 42 chars, return original HL"},
