        "6399": {"synopsis":"Find file on current File Eprom, identified by DE pointer string (null-terminated),\nand preserve pointer in (flentry).\nEntry: C = slot number of file area to scan; DE = pointer to search string (filename).\nExit: Fc = 1, No File Card; Fc = 0,; Fz = 0, file entry not found; Fz = 1, file entry found."},
