        "2300": {"synopsis":"Rebinds one stream of a CLI with RebindStream, then frees the CLI with FreeCli when none of\nits six streams is left open.\nEntry: IY = CLI block (bound in S1); BC = offset of the stream word (cli_instream ...); A =\nits CLIS_xxx flag; IX = new handle (0 closes the stream).\nExit: as RebindStream, or as FreeCli when the CLI was freed."},
