        "2799": {"synopsis":"Frees every CLI: calls FreeCli until it reports that no CLI is left.\nEntry: none.\nExit: Fc = 0; A = RC_Eof (from the last FreeCli); no CLI remains.\nChanges: AF, BC, DE, HL, IX, IY."},
