        "3119": {"synopsis":"Writes a byte to a stream with OS_Pbt, using the CLI's stored timeout.\nEntry: A = byte; IX = handle; IY = CLI block (bound).\nExit: Fc = 0.\nError: Fc = 1, A = error code (from OS_Pbt).\nKeeps: BC."},
        "3123": {"comment":"write byte A to handle IX, BC=timeout"},
        "3127": {"synopsis":"Frees the most recently invoked CLI, the head of eIdxCliList.\n1. Binds the CLI block into S1 and closes its six streams (RebindStream with IX = 0).\n2. Unlinks it from the list and releases the block with OS_Mfr (pIdxMemHandle).\n3. Decrements the CLI use count (OS_Cli, CL_DEC).\nEntry: none.\nExit: Fc and A as OS_Cli returns them; the CLI's bank stays bound in S1.\nError: Fc = 1, A = RC_Eof when no CLI is running.\nChanges: AF, BC, DE, HL, IX, IY (IY = eIdxCliList)."},
        "3131": {"comment":"End Of File"},
        "3139": {"comment":"bind CLI in S1"},
        "3140": {"comment":"close all streams"},
