        "3212": {"comment":"free CLI"},
        "3221": {"comment":"decrement CLI use count"},
        "3224": {"synopsis":"Writes CDE as the 3-byte link at IY.\nEntry: IY = list node or list head; C = bank; DE = address.\nExit: (IY+0..2) = E, D, C.\nChanges: none."},
