        "5366": {"synopsis":"Selects and clears the application window and lists up to 6 applications from\nubIdxTopApplication on, leaving out Index, each with its key (PrintApp). Stores the count in\nubIdxNApplDisplayed.\nEntry: none.","comment":"select & init appl window"},
