        "5412": {"comment":"newline"},
        "5425": {"synopsis":"Selects and clears the process window and lists up to 6 suspended processes from\nubIdxTopProcess on (PrintProcess). When the top process no longer exists, restarts from 0\n(and resets ubIdxSelectorPos when the process window is active). Stores the count in\nubIdxNProcDisplayed and prints \"NONE\" when there is none.\nEntry: none.","comment":"select & init proc window"},
        "5437": {"comment":"lines to print"},
        "5439": {"comment":"got top proc"},
