        "10157": {"comment":"load entire config file into allocated buffer in S0"},
        "10160": {"comment":"parse inital config version, OZ target slot and total banks"},
        "10215": {"comment":"6 identifies update command re-entry (DoUpdate)"},
        "10222": {"comment":"enable blinking cursor"},
        "10235": {"comment":"release memory and file handles, if open"},
        "10241": {"synopsis":"Releases what the OZ update holds: closes the config file (CloseCfgFile) and, when\nApp_MemHnd is not 0, closes the memory handle (ci_CloseMem); then App_MemHnd = 0.\nEntry: none.\nExit: IX = 0.","comment":"close \"ozupdate.cfg\" file, if opened"},
        "10251": {"comment":"release allocated memory, if any"},
        "10278": {"comment":"a specific error message was already displayed, just press ESC"},
        "10303": {"synopsis":"Closes the OZ update's config file when uwIdxCfgHnd holds a handle (GN_Cl) and stores the\nreturned IX (0) back.\nEntry: uwIdxCfgHnd = file handle or 0.\nExit: IX = 0 when a file was closed; otherwise IX = 0 from uwIdxCfgHnd.\nChanges: AF, IX."},
        "10319": {"synopsis":"Parse config, CRC-32 check OZ bank files, then erase & flash destination slot\nUpdate OZ in slot 0/1, defined via \"ozupdate.cfg\" file and OZ ROM bank files\nstored in :RAM.*\n\nThe config file will be parsed for OZ ROM target, CRC-32 check OZ bank files,\nerase the specified slot containing a AMD 512K flash chip, then blow the bank\nfiles from RAM into the slot, completed by a soft reset."},
        "10320": {"comment":"Wd #0 if 'No'"},
        "10338": {"comment":"just an info wd"},
        "10394": {"comment":"parse bank entries and CRC-32 check bank files"},
        "10397": {"comment":"release handle of allocated memory, so soft reset reports no warnings"},
        "10400": {"comment":"DC_Upd: IX register points at oz banks array"},
        "10408": {"comment":"ensure that banks array is available in S0 (upper 8K)"},
        "10414": {"comment":"DC_Upd: C = slot number from config file"},
        "10418": {"comment":"DC_Upd: B = total bank files to blow in slot"},
        "10419": {"comment":"update slot with OZ ROM banks (Amd flash chip)"},
        "10422": {"comment":"if DC_Upd returns, its because there were an error"},
        "10425": {"synopsis":"Load complete config file from RAM filing system into buffer\n\n......../..IY  same\nAFBCDEHL/IX..  different\nEntry: BHL = pointer to allocated buffer space for config file in S0.\nExit: HL = pointer to start of buffer information.; DE = pointer to end of buffer\ninformation; Fz = 1, if EOF reached, otherwise Fz = 0.","comment":"bind allocated memory in bank B to S0"},
        "10428": {"comment":"get handle..."},
        "10432": {"comment":"read max. bytes into buffer"},
        "10439": {"comment":"HL=0, DE points at buffer to load file contents"},
        "10440": {"comment":"read bytes from file"},
        "10442": {"comment":"Fc = 0"},
        "10450": {"comment":"number of bytes read physically from file"},
        "10452": {"comment":"HL points at end of block"},
        "10453": {"comment":"append a new line if last line of file is missing it..."},
        "10456": {"comment":"null-terminate end of loaded information"},
        "10458": {"comment":"end of buffer is byte after last newline"},
        "10461": {"comment":"DE: return L-end"},
        "10462": {"comment":"HL: return L-start"},
        "10469": {"synopsis":"Parse initial parameters from 'ozupdate.cfg' file:\n1) validate CFG.V3\n2) 'OZ',<total banks> (default slot 0)  or  'OZ.x',<total banks> (specified slot number)\nOZ source name: ReadConfigFileOzInfo.","comment":"init pointer to beginning of first line"},
        "10475": {"comment":"lineno = 0 (we haven't yet loaded a line...)"},
        "10478": {"comment":"get first line, containing the 'CFG.Vx' identification"},
        "10481": {"comment":"premature EOF!"},
        "10489": {"comment":"'CFG' was not identified..."},
        "10497": {"comment":"'.' was not identified..."},
        "10505": {"comment":"'Vx' was not identified..."},
        "10518": {"comment":"Allow \"V3\" config file format"},
        "10523": {"synopsis":"OZ source name: parse_cfgfile_lines.","comment":"fetch line containing command specification"},
        "10526": {"comment":"premature EOF!"},
        "10534": {"comment":"nothing recognized in this line, fetch a new one.."},
        "10543": {"comment":"'OZ' identifier?"},
