        "11078": {"synopsis":"IsSpace - check whether the ASCII byte is a white space\n\nA.BCDEHL/IXIY  same\n.F....../....  different\nEntry: A = ASCII byte.\nExit: Fz = 1, if byte was a white space, otherwise Fz = 0."},
        "11080": {"comment":"byte = ' '"},
        "11081": {"comment":"byte > ' ', not a white space"},
        "11082": {"comment":"0 <= byte < ' '"},
        "11084": {"synopsis":"IsDigit - check whether the ASCII byte is a digit or not.\n\nA.BCDEHL/IXIY  same\n.F....../....  different\nEntry: A = ASCII byte.\nExit: Fz = 1, if byte was a digit, otherwise Fz = 0."},
        "11086": {"comment":"byte >= '9'"},
        "11090": {"comment":"'0' <= byte < '9'"},
        "11092": {"synopsis":"IsAlpha - check whether the ASCII byte is an alphabetic character or not.\nThe underscore character is defined as an alphabetic character.\n\nA.BCDEHL/IXIY  same\n.F....../....  different\nEntry: A = ASCII byte.\nExit: Fz = 1, if byte was alphabetic, otherwise Fz = 0."},
        "11094": {"comment":"byte >= 'z'"},
        "11099": {"comment":"'a' <= byte < 'z'"},
        "11103": {"comment":"'_' <= byte < 'a'"},
        "11106": {"comment":"'z' <= byte < '_'"},
        "11109": {"comment":"byte < 'a', not alphabetic"},
        "11110": {"comment":"'a' <= byte < 'z', alphabtic found"},
        "11112": {"synopsis":"IsAlNum - check whether the ASCII byte is an alphanumeric character or not.\n\nA.BCDEHL/IXIY  same\n.F....../....  different\nEntry: A = ASCII byte.\nExit: Fz = 1, if byte was alphanumeric, otherwise Fz = 0."},
        "11120": {"synopsis":"StrChr - find character in string.\n\n..BCDEHL/IXIY  same\nAF....../....  different\nEntry: A = ASCII byte; HL = pointer to string, first byte defined as length byte.\nExit: Fz = 1: if byte was found in string.; A = position of found character in string (0 =\nfirst).; Fz = 0, byte not found, A last position of string."},
        "11124": {"comment":"get length of string"},
        "11125": {"comment":"point at first character"},
        "11126": {"comment":"search..."},
        "11129": {"comment":"preserve search flags"},
        "11132": {"comment":"a = position of found char."},
        "11134": {"comment":"restore search flags"},
        "11135": {"comment":"position in a"},
        "11138": {"synopsis":"ToUpper - convert character to upper case if possible.\n\n..BCDEHL/IXIY  same\nAF....../....  different\nEntry: A = ASCII byte.\nExit: A = converted ASCII byte.","comment":"if a <= 'z'  &&"},
        "11142": {"comment":"if a >= 'a'"},
