        "11303": {"synopsis":"Converts an ASCII hex digit ('0'-'9', 'A'-'F'; upper case only) to its value.\nEntry: A = character.\nExit: Fc = 0, A = 0-15.\nError: Fc = 1, A unchanged, when A is not a hex digit.\nChanges: AF."},
