        "11468": {"synopsis":"Wildcard name of the OZ update config file searched in RAM: \":RAM.?/ozs?-*.upd\",\nnull-terminated (the source's comments call it ozupdate.cfg).","comment":"the config file containing binary filenames and CRC"},
