        "11591": {"synopsis":"Banner text of the OZ update window: \"OPERATING SYSTEM UPDATE\", null-terminated."},
        "11615": {"synopsis":"Separator table of the config file parser: a length byte (27) followed by the separator\ncharacters (start_separators). The position of a character found by StrChr is its symbol\nnumber (sym_null, sym_dquote, ...)."},
        "11616": {"synopsis":"The 27 separator characters of the config file parser: null, double quote, single quote, ; ,\n. ( { } ) + - * / % ^ = & ~ | : ! < > #, CR and LF, in symbol order."},
        "11643": {"synopsis":"End of the separator table, used only to compute its length; the $FF filler follows."}
